'''Maddox Batphone''' is an {{Uncommon}} item used to contact {{NPCSprite|Maddox the Slayer}} remotely.

== Obtaining ==
=== Wolf Slayer ===
The '''Maddox Batphone''' is a reward from reaching {{CollectionLink|Wolf Slayer 3}}. Upon reaching this milestone, the crafting recipe for this item is also unlocked.

